<!--
  Synthetic ISO 20022 auth.080 SFTR feedback fixture for OpenDQI tests.
  Hand-authored — not derived from any ESMA or SWIFT example.

  Each <Sts> exercises one of the four SFTR feedback checks:
   1. Rjctd  → SFTR.FBK.TR_REJECTED_UTI
   2. Mssng  with UTI present in tier2.xml → SFTR.FBK.TR_MISSING_DESPITE_SUBMISSION
   3. Mssng  with UTI NOT in tier2.xml     → SFTR.FBK.TR_MISSING_BUT_NOT_SENT
   4. Inaccrt → SFTR.FBK.TR_INACCURATE_REPORTED
   5. RcncltnBrk → ingested but no check fires for v1.
-->
